<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Florence Bagnard is a French politician who has been appointed as the Prefect of Lozère, becoming the first female to hold this position. She is known for her advocacy on rural development and environmental issues and is committed to promoting economic growth, improving public services, and protecting the natural heritage of the region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PREFECT OF LOZÈRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prefect of Lozère is a position in French politics, responsible for overseeing the region's administrative services, ensuring public safety, and implementing national policies at the local level."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOZÈRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lozère is a department in southern France where Florence Bagnard has been appointed as the Prefect, marking a significant milestone for the region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"MENDE is a commune in Lozère where Florence Bagnard was officially sworn in as the Prefect."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTRY OF THE INTERIOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Ministry of the Interior is responsible for overseeing the Prefects and their duties in various regions of France."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Ministry of the Interior oversees the Prefects and their duties in various regions of France."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIERRE ROUSSEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre Roussel is the mayor of the nearby town of Marvejols and a supporter of Florence Bagnard's appointment as Prefect of Lozère."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GÉRALD DARMANIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gérald Darmanin is the Minister of the Interior and has expressed confidence in Florence Bagnard's ability to excel in her new role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSEILLER MUNICIPAL DE GIVRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Conseiller municipal de Givry is a position in local politics, responsible for making decisions on local issues such as urban planning, transportation, and community development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GIVRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Givry is a commune in the Yonne department in France where Florence Bagnard holds the position of conseiller municipal."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YONNE DEPARTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yonne department is a department in France where Florence Bagnard is a conseiller municipal of Givry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARVEJOLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marvejols is a nearby town to Lozère where Pierre Roussel is the mayor and supports Florence Bagnard's appointment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YONNE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yonne is a department in France where Givry is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"France is the country where Florence Bagnard is active in both her roles as Prefect of Lozère and conseiller municipal of Givry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RURAL DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rural Development is an area of focus for Florence Bagnard, emphasizing economic growth and improvement of living conditions in rural areas."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL ISSUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental Issues are another area of focus for Florence Bagnard, highlighting the importance of protecting natural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public Services are a priority for Florence Bagnard, aiming to improve the quality and accessibility of services for the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECONOMIC GROWTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Economic Growth is a key goal for Florence Bagnard, focusing on revitalizing rural areas and supporting small businesses."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABLE TOURISM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sustainable Tourism is mentioned as one of Florence Bagnard's priorities, promoting responsible travel practices."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POPULATION DECLINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Population Decline is a challenge faced by Lozère, with many young people leaving the region in search of better job opportunities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOUNG PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON_GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Young People are a demographic group that has left Lozère in search of better job opportunities, contributing to the population decline."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT COMMITMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Government Commitment is highlighted by Gérald Darmanin, emphasizing the importance of promoting diversity and inclusion in public institutions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0269</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;PREFECT OF LOZÈRE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Florence Bagnard has been appointed as the Prefect of Lozère, becoming the first female to hold this position in the region's history."</data>
      <data key="d5">"pioneering, leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;LOZÈRE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Florence Bagnard is the Prefect of Lozère, responsible for overseeing the region's administrative services and implementing national policies locally."</data>
      <data key="d5">"administrative responsibility, regional governance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;MENDE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Florence Bagnard was officially sworn in as the Prefect of Lozère in MENDE, a commune in Lozère."</data>
      <data key="d5">"inauguration, official recognition"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;MINISTRY OF THE INTERIOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Florence Bagnard's appointment as Prefect of Lozère is overseen by the Ministry of the Interior, which is responsible for managing such positions across France."</data>
      <data key="d5">"government oversight, policy implementation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;PIERRE ROUSSEL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Pierre Roussel, the mayor of Marvejols, supports Florence Bagnard's appointment as Prefect of Lozère, seeing her as a champion for the region's development."</data>
      <data key="d5">"local support, community advocate"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;GÉRALD DARMANIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Gérald Darmanin, the Minister of the Interior, expresses confidence in Florence Bagnard's ability to excel in her new role as Prefect of Lozère."</data>
      <data key="d5">"government endorsement, confidence in leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FLORENCE BAGNARD&quot;" target="&quot;CONSEILLER MUNICIPAL DE GIVRY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Florence Bagnard holds the position of conseiller municipal de Givry, a role in local politics responsible for making decisions on local issues."</data>
      <data key="d5">"local governance, community service"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0269</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
